    "outcome": "Any LLM host that can read a project instruction file or run git commit is bound to the same new-project contract: allocate via new-ticket.sh, stay on a ticket branch, stay inside allowedPaths. A fail-closed hook rejects unbound commits. An installer copies the same files into other clones and user-level host dirs.",
