    "architecture": {
      "status": "accepted",
      "decision": "Ship the same short contract as GEMINI.md, CLAUDE.md and a Cursor alwaysApply rule, plus a git pre-commit hook that requires branch ticket-NNN with Status IN_PROGRESS. install-agent-hosts.sh materializes those files into a target clone and optional user-level host dirs. package-manifest adoption waits for leftover ticket-089 to close.",
